WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.130 --> 00:00:03.290
- But, you know, the thing about Idol is,

00:00:03.290 --> 00:00:04.890
it's just a fun gig.

00:00:04.890 --> 00:00:06.003
I mean, when you,

00:00:06.910 --> 00:00:11.910
when you are part of
being the first people

00:00:13.510 --> 00:00:15.810
to see a star being born,

00:00:15.810 --> 00:00:17.930
I mean, when you look at like, I mean,

00:00:17.930 --> 00:00:19.350
I was riding down the road,

00:00:19.350 --> 00:00:22.060
listenin' to the radio
and I'm listening to

00:00:22.060 --> 00:00:25.260
Gabby Barrett's second single.

00:00:25.260 --> 00:00:27.520
And obviously we know that,

00:00:27.520 --> 00:00:29.700
you know, her first, you know,

00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:34.700
her first single was just
massive and now I'm like, God,

00:00:35.090 --> 00:00:38.290
I never will forget her
walking in the room.

00:00:38.290 --> 00:00:43.290
And I knew that she was
just a world-class singer.

00:00:44.080 --> 00:00:48.370
And, obviously working with
Lionel and Katie and Ryan,

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:51.020
it's no drama, you know, I'm not,

00:00:51.020 --> 00:00:54.900
I'm not trying to be a bigger
star than Katy Perry and Lord,

00:00:54.900 --> 00:00:57.630
we know we'll never be a
bigger star than Lionel Richie.

00:00:57.630 --> 00:01:00.850
So everybody has their fun little role.

00:01:00.850 --> 00:01:02.490
And we just focus on the kids.

00:01:02.490 --> 00:01:05.620
We don't, we're not in it for, you know,

00:01:05.620 --> 00:01:08.802
we're not in it to go, you know.

00:01:08.802 --> 00:01:10.991
- That's the coolest part,
to be surrounded by people.

00:01:10.991 --> 00:01:12.070
I love that too.

00:01:12.070 --> 00:01:13.320
Like, when you're, I've,

00:01:13.320 --> 00:01:15.150
I've worked with actually
Legend, John Legend

00:01:15.150 --> 00:01:16.633
on a couple different shows,

00:01:17.910 --> 00:01:19.833
like, you know a singing competition show.

00:01:19.833 --> 00:01:22.340
And, one thing I love
that we've kind of had

00:01:22.340 --> 00:01:24.800
sitting in on the previous show
and now on The Voice, like,

00:01:24.800 --> 00:01:27.430
is we both just love music.

00:01:27.430 --> 00:01:28.482
We're like that too.

00:01:28.482 --> 00:01:30.580
We really feed off of
each other a lot too.

00:01:30.580 --> 00:01:32.800
And then obviously Blake and,
and Gwen's on this season.

00:01:32.800 --> 00:01:34.700
So it's like, once you
have people, you know,

00:01:34.700 --> 00:01:35.590
you and Katie and Lionel,

00:01:35.590 --> 00:01:36.590
y'all are already established,

00:01:36.590 --> 00:01:37.650
you've already done so many things.

00:01:37.650 --> 00:01:40.910
You're already excited and you
make it about these artists,

00:01:40.910 --> 00:01:42.410
you know and less of yourself.

00:01:42.410 --> 00:01:44.860
That's I think that's
when you win inevitably.

00:01:44.860 --> 00:01:46.410
And that's, that's really cool.

